---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const SITE = 'https://dogtur.com';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Dogtur | Dogtur"
  description="Dogtur is an independent guide for parents of senior dogs: honest, research-based advice and product reviews — hands-on testing on the roadmap."
  canonical={`${SITE}/about/`}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About Dogtur</h1>
    <p>
      Dogtur is an independent guide for people caring for aging dogs. We exist
      because senior dogs are underserved: most pet content is written for
      puppies and prime-age adults, while the questions that come with a gray
      muzzle — arthritis, appetite changes, cognitive decline, end-of-life
      decisions — get thin, generic answers.
    </p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Research-first guides.</strong> Every guide is built from deep research — attributed test findings, verified owner reviews, and veterinary guidance — framed around what to ask your vet.</li>
      <li><strong>Research-based reviews, testing on the roadmap.</strong> Review picks today come from attributed independent testing, verified owner-review analysis, and spec verification — never presented as our own tests. Hands-on testing with real senior dogs is the next step, and we'll say so plainly when it begins.</li>
      <li><strong>No miracle claims.</strong> We don't promise cures, rank by commission, or publish health content without vet-aware framing.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>
      Dogtur is <strong>not a veterinary authority</strong>. Health content on
      this site describes signs to discuss with your veterinarian — it never
      diagnoses your dog, prescribes dosages, or replaces professional care.
      See our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for the full rules.
    </p>
    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>
      Dogtur is reader-supported. Some links on review and comparison pages are
      affiliate links: if you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no
      extra cost to you. Commissions never influence rankings or verdicts. Full
      details on the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> page.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions, corrections, or testing suggestions: <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
